  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Objective:\nDetermine the spring constant (k) of a helical spring.\n\nFormulas:\n 
    x = L - L0   (Extension, convert cm to m)\n  F = m * g    (g = 9.81 m/s^2, m
    in kg)\n  k = F / x    (Spring constant in N/m)\n  T = t / 10   (Time period
    of 1 oscillation)\n\nProcedure:\n1. Measure natural length L0\n2. Attach mass
    (50g - 250g)\n3. Measure stretched length L\n4. Pull & release; time 10 oscillations\n5.
    Review k and click PROCEED"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
